<main id="top"><div class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">St. Joseph, Missouri · Drop-off &amp; mobile by request</div><h1>Cracked screen?<br><em>Let's revive it.</em></h1><p>Convenient iPhone screen, battery, and back glass repairs. Schedule a local drop-off, or ask about mobile service. Clear quotes before any work begins.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="#quote">Request a repair →</a><a class="btn alt" href="tel:+18163483989">Call (816) 348-3989</a></div><div class="trust"><span>90-day parts &amp; labor warranty</span><span>Quality-focused replacement parts</span><span>Drop-off first · Mobile by request</span></div></div><div><img class="logo" src="tech-revive-logo.png" width="1024" height="1024" loading="eager" alt="Tech Revive logo: Fast. Friendly. Revived." ></div></div></div>
<section id="services"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">What we do</div><h2 class="section-title">Repairs without the runaround.</h2><p class="lead">Tell us your exact phone model and what's going on. We'll confirm part availability and give you an installed quote before you commit.</p><div class="cards"><article class="card"><div class="symbol" aria-hidden="true">📱</div><h3>Screen repair</h3><p>Cracked glass, display issues, and touch problems. We choose reliable, compatible replacement screens instead of low-quality Incell substitutions.</p></article><article class="card"><div class="symbol" aria-hidden="true">🔋</div><h3>Battery replacement</h3><p>Battery wearing out or not holding a charge? Ask us to check parts and pricing for your model.</p></article><article class="card"><div class="symbol" aria-hidden="true">🛠️</div><h3>Back glass repair</h3><p>Broken rear glass? Request a model-specific quote and we'll check repair options and availability.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="stripe" id="how"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Simple process · Drop-off or mobile by request</div><h2 class="section-title">Here's how it works.</h2><div class="steps"><div class="step"><span class="num">1</span><h3>Tell us what's wrong</h3><p>Send your model and the issue. Photos of exterior damage help.</p></div><div class="step"><span class="num">2</span><h3>Get a clear quote</h3><p>We check the correct part, total installed price, estimated delivery, and deposit terms before ordering.</p></div><div class="step"><span class="num">3</span><h3>Schedule your repair</h3><p>Once your part arrives, arrange a drop-off appointment or ask whether mobile service is available. You usually keep your phone while we wait for parts.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section><div class="wrap two"><div><div class="eyebrow">The Tech Revive difference</div><h2 class="section-title">We'll tell you if insurance makes more sense.</h2><p>If you have AppleCare+, carrier protection, or phone insurance, check your coverage and deductible first. A covered repair might cost you less.</p><p>We also avoid Incell replacement screens because of past reliability problems. We'll explain the screen option and any known limitations before your repair.</p><div class="note">Our goal is the right repair for your phone, not just the cheapest part.</div></div><div class="panel"><h3>What to expect</h3><p><strong>Drop-off:</strong> Our primary option. We privately confirm the location after arranging your appointment; no walk-in storefront.</p><p><strong>Mobile service:</strong> Available by request for eligible repairs, depending on distance, schedule, and working conditions. Any travel fee is quoted in advance.</p><p><strong>Timing:</strong> Many standard screen repairs take around 30 minutes once parts are ready, but actual time varies by device and condition.</p><p><strong>Warranty:</strong> 90-day parts and labor coverage. Ask for full terms and exclusions before approving a repair.</p><p><strong>Parts:</strong> Ordered as needed for your exact model. Shipping dates are estimates, not guarantees.</p><p><strong>Price:</strong> Confirmed individually after reviewing your device and replacement part.</p></div></div></section>
